If you re-enter a level some monster attributes are indeed updated,
e.g. tameness. This is done in
mon_catchup_elapsed_time() {/* heal monster for time spent elsewhere */}.

Of course you do not need the source; I just tried with an ordinary
healer ('x' stands for entering the character 'x'):

